   "text": "Thanks, Victor, you're verified. I checked order Q-7801 from Taqueria Luz.\n\nThe order was promised for 6:15 PM and handed to you at 6:45 PM. That's 30 minutes late, so it qualifies for compensation. The compensation for that range is account credit equal to the delivery fee, which is $2.99 on this order.\n\nAn earlier support contact tonight already issued that $2.99 credit for this order. It's on your account now. I can't add a second credit for the same delay.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with, such as a missing or wrong item on this order?"
