   "text": "I understand it's frustrating, especially when you're waiting on dinner. For a delay of 16 to 44 minutes, though, the most I can offer is credit equal to the delivery fee. You've already received that $2.99. I can't offer more, and I can't add goodwill compensation beyond what the policy allows.\n\nIf anything was wrong with the order itself, like a missing or incorrect item, tell me and I'll look into it. Otherwise, is there anything else I can help with?"
